\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-auto object-cover object-center\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=256&q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=384&q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.tarkov.dev%2Fblack-div-poster.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></div><div class=\"mb-2 flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p>The Black Division is&#160;a highly skilled, mysterious, and elite tactical unit in&#160;Escape from Tarkov&#160;lore, primarily acting as the clandestine, elite \"cleanup crew\" for TerraGroup. Known for appearing in the&#160;<em>Raid</em>&#160;series (Episode 5) and appears as a major threat only on the <!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"\"></template><!--/$-->  and <!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"\"></template><!--/$--> map, they represent a professional, western-equipped force that annihilates all witnesses.</p></div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Tactics</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p><strong>Elite NPCs:</strong></p><ul class=\"my-4 space-y-2 list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"text-base leading-relaxed\">Found only on the Terminal and Icebreaker location, added in the 1.0 release</li><li class=\"text-base leading-relaxed\">Top-tier gear and armor</li><li class=\"text-base leading-relaxed\">Aggressive and highly accurate AI</li><li class=\"text-base leading-relaxed\">Operate as a team, flank, and use grenades</li></ul><p><strong>How to fight them:</strong></p><p><strong>1. Don’t take head-on fights</strong><br>Play around cover, use quick peeks.</p><p><strong>2. Keep your distance</strong><br>Mid-range is the safest option.</p><p><strong>3. Split the group</strong><br>Lure them one by one, avoid fighting all at once.</p><p><strong>4. Use grenades</strong><br>Force movement and break their positioning.</p><p><strong>5. Aim for weak spots</strong><br>Head, face, chest.</p><p><strong>6. Play off sound</strong><br>They are predictable through footsteps and actions.</p><p><strong>Recommended gear:</strong></p><ul class=\"my-4 space-y-2 list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"text-base leading-relaxed\">Armor: Class 5–6</li><li class=\"text-base leading-relaxed\">Ammo: High penetration</li><li class=\"text-base leading-relaxed\">Must-have: grenades</li></ul></div></div></div><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold\">Spawn locations</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"ml-2 underline\" href=\"/en/map/regular/terminal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-anchor mr-1 inline-block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v16\" /><path d=\"m19 13 2-1a9 9 0 0 1-18 0l2 1\" /><path d=\"M9 11h6\" /><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\" /></svg>Terminal (100%)</a><ul class=\"text-muted-foreground mt-1 ml-4 space-y-1 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"ml-2 underline\" href=\"/en/map/regular/terminal?q=Zone1BD1PortAmbush1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"no